===Verb===
{{en-verb|head=[[daylight]]|daylights|daylighting|daylighted|past2=daylit}}

# To expose to daylight
# {{label|en|architecture}} To provide sources of natural illumination such as [[skylight]]s or windows.
# To allow light in, as by drawing [[drapes]].
# {{label|en|landscaping|civil engineering}} To run a drainage pipe to an opening from which its contents can drain away naturally.
# {{label|en|intransitive}} To gain exposure to the open.
#: ''The seam of coal '''daylighted''' at a cliff by the river.''

